{"title":"Career Roadmap · Clinical Engineer","role":"Clinical Engineer","summary":"Career objective: Become a Clinical Engineer who applies engineering, medical-device, safety, data and healthcare-technology knowledge to ensure that medical equipment and clinical technology are safe, reliable, effective, compliant and properly integrated into patient-care environments.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Clinical engineering sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Biomedical Engineering","Medical Devices","Hospital Operations","Patient Safety","Healthcare Technology"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/B.E. Biomedical Engineering + electronics + medical instrumentation + clinical exposure"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Clinical Engineer / Biomedical Engineer / Medical Equipment Engineer"}],[{"text":"2033–2038"},{"text":"Senior Clinical Engineer / Medical Device Specialist"}],[{"text":"2038–2042"},{"text":"Clinical Engineering Lead / Healthcare Technology Manager"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Principal Clinical Engineer / Hospital Technology Manager / Medical Technology Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Tech/B.E.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering and healthcare foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Basic biology"},{"text":"Human anatomy and physiology"},{"text":"Electrical engineering"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Technical communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Begin understanding:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human body","physiological signal","medical sensor","instrument","clinical mea