Technology assessment"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Equipment lifecycle management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Advanced clinical engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical-device risk management"},{"text":"Medical-device regulations"},{"text":"Quality systems"},{"text":"Clinical technology assessment"},{"text":"Healthcare cybersecurity"},{"text":"Medical-device software"},{"text":"Hospital information systems"},{"text":"Biomedical equipment networking"},{"text":"IoT-enabled medical devices"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"AI in healthcare"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Patient safety"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A clinical engineer should learn to ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"Is the technology clinically appropriate, technically reliable, safe, maintainable and cost-effective?"},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year project"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended project"},{"type":"h","text":"“IoT-Based Medical Equipment Monitoring and Predictive Maintenance System”"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible components:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monitor equipment operating parameters"},{"text":"Collect equipment-status data"},{"text":"Detect abnormal behaviour"},{"text":"Create maintenance alerts"},{"text":"Build an equipment dashboard"},{"text":"Develop failure-risk indicators"},{"text":"Analyse maintenance history"},{"text":"Demonstrate preventive/predictive maintenance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Other strong projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECG monitoring system"},{"text":"Smart patient monitoring"},{"text":"Medical equipment asset-management system"},{"text":"AI-based ECG abnormality classification"},{"text":"Remote equipment monitoring"},{"text":"Medical-device cybersecurity"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance for hospital equipment"},{"text":"Infusion-pump monitoring"},{"text":"ICU equipment utilisation analytics"},{"text":"Biomedical equipment inventory platform"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours 